Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "DogCrossingScenario" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:actor1 a :Actor ;
    :description "A dog running across the road in front of the vehicle" .

:weather1 a :ClearCondition .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "High risk of collision with a living creature crossing the vehicle path unexpectedly" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.90"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Potential collision with a dog crossing the road abruptly from behind parked vehicles.
Severity Score: 0.90